        },
        "quote": "(b) In order to protect the safety of the City’s water supply, including maintaining the integrity of any water intake located on the Kansas River, the Utilities Director may take appropriate measures to prohibit individuals from entering or remaining within 150 feet of such intake. Such measures may include, but are not limited to, cordoning off the area and posting signs warning of criminal penalties for trespass.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:13.10.030:block:1#text",
