          "start": 532
        },
        "quote": "(c) The Utilities Director shall have the authority to make account adjustments, settle contract disputes, and write off accounts related to the utility billing system and accounts receivable for the purpose of correcting errors, settling disputed accounts, and inducing prompt payment for any amount up to $10,000. Any account adjustments, write-offs, contract disputes or settlements of disputed accounts exceeding $10,000 shall be approved by the Governing Body. (Ord. 20089 § 4, 10-17-17.)",
